Short:        Freeware Dice (2.06.37)
Author:       info@oic.com
Uploader:     jochen wiedmann zdv uni-tuebingen de
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is version 2.06.37 of the Dice C compiler, extracted from the
commercial version 3.01.

The announcement states, that you can run it from floppy, but the
unpacked archive extends the size of one disk, so I recommend a
hard drive.
